(text "NOTES:" (at 20.32 330.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 88ff2156-34c1-50bf-9c0e-124a7f2cf129))
(text "Mu VIN and onboard eDP BL_PWR use regulated MU_12V; the exact B160QAN03.K harness/pinout remains a release gate." (at 20.32 337.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e4a07b08-617d-5e8f-9950-ab96f3d5a841))
(text "Ultra USB3 ports 1/2 retain their links. PCIe lane 4 and USB2 P6 feed M.2 E-key; verify USB companion pairing on the kit." (at 20.32 345.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 94e6d6fb-eab2-517c-96e8-73b4e1356a75))
(text "The verified B160QAN03.K panel connects to the Mu onboard eDP connector; DDIB is unused." (at 20.32 354.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid ec6b9a2c-1ccd-5765-84bb-dabaf6b531e9))
(text "TCP2 HDMI lane/HPD/DDC nets leave through the right-board signal cable for the external HDMI-A output." (at 20.32 361.95 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 19134b84-d662-58c8-b4d3-6975fc76cca0))
(text "USB2_P3 is EC; P4 pairs with USB-C 2; P5 is the system-audio hub; P7 is maker MCU; P8 is trackpad." (at 20.32 369.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid c68af798-928f-5133-8b74-26f7410057b3))
(text "Native USB-C data/OC nets leave to sheet 4; VBUS switching, CC, muxing, and ESD live there." (at 20.32 378.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 80438629-1f30-55f7-877e-a2de0008f0bd))
(text "SYS_5V uses externally compensated LM706A0 at 4.5A; SYS_3V3 uses TPS56637 with a complete bank below 100uF. source admission remains separate." (at 20.32 386.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a296a507-724c-5a79-b1e0-478988491841))
(text "M.2 M-key uses Ultra PCIe lanes 5-8 x4, REFCLK2 and CLKREQ2; no lane reversal or TX/RX direction swap." (at 20.32 393.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 561b9f85-b4a0-5732-8f47-3a230423841c))
(text "M.2 M-key: Mu TX->PET through 220n near J10; PET/PER naming is from the host perspective." (at 20.32 401.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a7fee3e0-a206-5648-8bfc-db4d23cfab5b))
(text "USB2 P6 serves Bluetooth. The trackpad is on internal hub U400 port 2; the EC remains directly on native USB2 P4." (at 20.32 408.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 208ac860-2851-52d9-af88-1d14e8f57858))
(text "MU_12V is a TPS552892EVM-derived 12V stage: 400kHz forced PWM, 3.33A nominal limit, and about 8.65-9.40V worst-case rising UVLO. Firmware requires VSYS >=10.0V." (at 20.32 416.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f0de01d0-c13b-5f80-b80e-0a28fe7bcba0))
(text "MU_12V_ENABLE is active high and defaults low. Q750/Q751 force EN/UVLO low until EC firmware explicitly releases the rail; MU_12V_PG is pulled up to MCU_3V3." (at 20.32 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid b366bc7c-0817-5f0b-9096-e63d02f731f4))
(text "POWER BUDGET HOLD: MU_12V is about 40W maximum for Mu plus eDP backlight. Lock BIOS PL1/PL2 only after measuring panel and whole-module draw; unrestricted 35W CPU mode is not released." (at 20.32 431.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 1f864366-8b37-5cf3-bba0-e3e6bace9f98))
(text "MU_S0_HIGH is Mu PSON with the required 10k pull-up to always-on MCU_3V3. It is a weak status signal for logic/NMOS gates only, never a load supply." (at 20.32 439.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 2a24e6a1-0418-5f2a-9ef5-6cb46562fb68))
(text "SLEEP POLICY: PSON is low in S3, so PCIe endpoint 3V3, user USB-C VBUS, trackpad, maker USB, and internal audio detach. Wake from those devices is intentionally unsupported." (at 20.32 447.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 7bdab72b-f6d7-5c4c-8c46-33673a02d8bd))
(text "MECHANICAL: the 8.0mm standard-orientation TE 2309411-1 socket requires two grounded 5.5mm M2 standoffs at H1/H2; SO-DIMM clips alone are not structural retention." (at 20.32 454.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 844b7d8a-a6e5-5077-81ae-ed48284be999))
(text "MECHANICAL: H3 is the grounded 2280 retainer for the 4.2mm M-key socket. H10-H17 are isolated M2.5 chassis holes; chassis bonding is a separate controlled point." (at 20.32 462.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 2a2c3cf3-3e28-5de8-8796-93f37b8c3aab))
(sheet_instances
